  "notes": "TED Search API v3 answered anonymous POST queries with real notices (no key). notice-type separates contract notices (cn-standard, 2.95M) from contract award notices (can-standard, 2.86M), so tender publication and award publication are distinguishable. The award winner is NOT in the search index: winner-name / winner-partname come back null even for a 2024 medical award notice, so an award→supplier link cannot be built from the search API; a full-text FT~ query finds notices that merely mention a firm. CPV is a category, not a device ID. The ted.europa.eu web host serves a 'Human Verification' challenge (notice_xml_on_web_host, bulk_downloads_page), so anonymous bulk XML download is NOT verified.",
